    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eipotuo Olaitoriani iltung'ana lenyena metorrinyokinoto ninye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Esr 4.24–5.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore to lapa le isiet tiatua olari liare le nkitoria e Darias, eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enetii Sakaria olayioni le Berekia olayioni le Ido, ilo oiboni le Nkai ejoki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Etagore apa Olaitoriani oleng tenkaraki iloo papaai linyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa tiaaki ninche, ena ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani: Entushukunye enatii, ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, naa kashukokino sii nanu intae, ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emitiuu anaa enaikununo apa iloo papaai linyi, laa ore apa lelo oibonok le Nkai le dukuya eishirakita ninche ejoki, Nji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, Entushukunye entung'uai nkoitoi inyi torrok o nkiasin inyi torrok! Kake eitu ninche aaning arashu aashilaa nanu, ejo Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaa taata iloo papaai linyi koree taata ninche? O loibonok, kebikoo sii ninche intarasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore irorei laainei o nkiguanat aainei, nena apa naitanapa isinkan laainei lelo oibonok le Nkai, keitu ninche egiroo iloo papaai linyi? Metaa eirridutua ninche ejo, Anaa enatumuta Olaitoriani loo lororani pee eitame iyiook tenkaraki inkoitoi ang o siaaitin ang, neaku ina eitaasa ninye iyiook.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enduaata o Loiboni le Nkai oo mbartan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkolong e tikitam oo ng'uan o lapa le tomon oobo, olapa le Shebat",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shebat",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "olapa loo Lhebrania le rishata olapa lo lodalu o arat",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to lari liare le nkitoria olaiguanani Darias, eewuo ororei lo Laitoriani enetii Sakaria olayioni le Berekia olayioni le Ido ilo oiboni le Nkai; nejo Sakaria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.2+REV.6.3+REV.6.4+REV.6.5+REV.6.6+REV.6.7+REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Emb 6.2-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Atoduaa tena kewarie naa ing'ura, oltung'ani okedito embarta nanyokie! Negira duoo aitashe tiatua ilkeek oo nyori ooji mihadasi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mihadasi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ilkeek laa ore enkadori enye naa ntemat enkaina intomoni ile, neeta mbenek naarropil o ntapuka naaelareki",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tiatua oyerata ore tesiadi ninye netii kulie bartan pilei, o naanyokie o naaibor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naitoki ajo, ‘Ainyoo doi kuna Olaitoriani lai?’ Ore ilo malaika laairorie nanu, aatiaaka, ‘Ekaaitodol aitayiolo ajo ainyoo ninche.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa etawala ilo tung'ani oitashe tiatua lelo keek ooji mihadasi ajoki ‘ore kuna naa inaairriwua Olaitoriani meetu aaman enkop pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki ilo malaika lo Laitoriani otii atua ilkeek ooji mihadasi ejo, Kishomo aarrip enkop pooki, naa ng'ura, nikitoduaa aajo eeta enkop pooki enkiyeng'iyengata!’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neitoki ilo malaika lo Laitoriani ajoki, iyie Olaitoriani loo lororani, kerishata nabaa miata olng'ur tiatua Yerusalem o nkanas e Yuda, nena nitagorokine tiatua kulo arin intomoni naapishana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki Olaitoriani ilo malaika laairorie too rorei supati le nkitagoloto e oshoke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa ore ilo malaika laairorie aatiaaka, Inchira tabuaku tejo, ena ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani: Aata olom sapuk tenkaraki Yerusalem o Sion. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natagorokine oleng lelo oshon oodol ate anaa keserian. Amu ore apa pee agorokino ninche penyo, neitaa lelo oshon osina sapuk te ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa, ina ejo Olaitoriani, atushukokine Yerusalem to lng'ur sapuk; naa ekesheti enkaji ai tiatua ninye, ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani nepiki enkopito e nkitorioroto shumata Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaaki inchira tejo, nji Olaitoriani loo lororani; Ekeitoki inkanas aainei aatum dupoto nalus, naa keitoki Olaitoriani aitagol Sion oshoke neigil agelu Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enduaata oo mowuarak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naraposhu inkonyek aainei aingorisho, naa ng'ura, imowuarak ong'uan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Najoki ilo malaika laairorie nanu, “Ainyoo doi kuna?” Naawaliki ninye ajoki, “Ore kuna mowuarak naa ninche naaidapasha Yuda, o Israel o Yerusalem.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naaitoki Olaitoriani aitodol ilkunono oong'uan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Najo nanu, “Kainyoo doi epuonu kulo aas?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal ajo, “Ore kuna naa imowuarak naa ninche naaidapasha Yuda metaa meetae oltung'ani oraposhu endukuya; neetuo kuna aaiture ninche, pee etum aitadou abori imowuarak oo loshon, lelo ootudumutua imowuarak enye aaitame ina kop e Yuda aaidapash ninye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ZEC.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "ZEC"
  },
